---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../site";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy & Call Tracking | We Pay Probate"
  description="How this website handles phone links and optional analytics."
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap section policy">
    <p class="eyebrow">WE PAY PROBATE</p><h1>Privacy & call tracking</h1><p>
      This website provides information and links to call We Pay Probate. It
      does not collect information through a contact form.
    </p><h2>Phone calls</h2><p>
      Clicking a call link opens your device’s phone application. Information
      you share on a call is provided to the business, rather than collected by
      this website. Ask the business about how it handles that information
      before sharing sensitive details.
    </p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>
      {
        /^G-[A-Z0-9]+$/.test(site.gaId)
          ? "Google Analytics is enabled on this version of the site."
          : "Google Analytics is not enabled on this version of the site."
      } Phone-link clicks generate a local browser event with the page path and button
      location. When Google Analytics is enabled, those events and page visits may
      be sent to Google; analytics may use cookies and process device and usage information.
      Event data does not include what you discuss on a call.
    </p><p>
      A phone-link click measures an attempted call action, not a connected
      call. This site does not use dynamic number insertion or a connected-call
      attribution service.
    </p><h2>Introduction video</h2><p>
      If a YouTube introduction is available, its thumbnail is loaded from YouTube’s image service, which may receive technical request information. Pressing the play button loads the
      video from YouTube’s privacy-enhanced domain. YouTube may receive device
      and usage information when you choose to play it. The site does not load a
      YouTube player before that action. A video hosted directly with the site
      uses the hosting provider to deliver its media files.
    </p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>
      The hosting provider may process technical request information, such as IP
      addresses, to deliver and protect the website.
    </p><h2>Call recording</h2><p>
      This website does not record calls or implement a call-recording service.
      Any future call tracking or recording requires an updated disclosure and
      appropriate consent arrangements.
    </p><h2>Questions</h2><p>
      For questions about information handling, call <a
        href={site.phoneHref}
        data-call-location="privacy">{site.phone}</a
      >.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
